				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# Core Commands\n\nThese are the public bvc commands. They are the commands we expect people to use.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "ffZ7GPd0Tw+vO4M+SZtB/w=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Project commands\n\n```sh\nbvc init\n```\n\nInitialise the current directory as a Catalyst project.\n\n```sh\nbvc create <projectName>\n```\n\nCreate a new project directory and initialise it.\n\n```sh\nbvc pull\n```\n\nPull the configured project sets.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "tI7hpc7HS6u8s5SnAVV2jQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Development tools\n\n```sh\nbvc devkit\n```\n\nBuild if needed, refresh connectors, then launch the Catalyst DevKit.\n\n```sh\nbvc j4p\n```\n\nBuild if needed, then launch Jadeite for Pharo.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "7d1WAXyFRIKh+re3gw2jJw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Deployments\n\n```sh\nbvc list\n```\n\nList registered deployments and running stones.\n\n```sh\nbvc start <deploymentName> [--with-seaside]\n```\n\nStart a deployment, installing it first if needed.\n\n```sh\nbvc stop <deploymentName>\n```\n\nStop a deployment.\n\n```sh\nbvc delete <deploymentName> [-f|--force]\n```\n\nDelete a deployment and its data. Without `--force`, bvc asks for confirmation.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "r7rlWLMFRT2MCGjI23oVqw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## What is intentionally not here\n\nThere is no public `--registry` option. Registry selection is configuration, not command line API.\n\nThere are no old command names such as `catalystStone`, `createDevStone`, `setup`, or `gt`. The command line should say what the user is trying to do, not what the underlying scripts used to be called.\n"
			}
		]
	},
